<title>CHINA: Chevalier Int'l year net jumps 65.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Chevalier Int'l year net jumps 65.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	  32	   vs  20.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)   7.0	  vs  5.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	 33.65 gain vs  84.45 loss</p>
<p>    Net			   240.67     vs  145.25</p>
<p>    Turnover		    5,463.94   vs  4,970.92</p>
<p>    Company name		Chevalier International Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		 September 15-23</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	  November 3</p>
<p>NOTE - Chevalier International is an installer of air-conditioning systems, escalators and industrial equipment.</p>
<p>The company proposes a bonus issue of one share for every 10 shares held.</p>
<p>Exceptional gain is from write back of provision for diminution in value of investment in a property joint venture project.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 11.5 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 4.5 cents) vs nine cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
